  "goodToKnow": "Die Kolumne is a newspaper or magazine column, a regular opinion piece by the same writer: eine Kolumne schreiben. Der Kolumnist (die Kolumnistin) writes it. Careful: a table column is die Spalte, and an architectural column is die Säule. Bastian Sick's Spiegel column Zwiebelfisch, about German grammar mistakes, became the bestseller Der Dativ ist dem Genitiv sein Tod. Plural: die Kolumnen."
